 "summary": "A single N-channel HEXFET power MOSFET in the three-lead Micro3 (SOT-23) package, intended for load and system switching. It blocks 20 V and is specified for gate drive as low as 2.5 V: on-resistance is 21.0 mΩ max with 4.5 V on the gate and 27.0 mΩ max with 2.5 V. It carries 6.3 A continuously at 25 °C ambient and 32 A in pulses; the gate is rated ±12 V. Free of lead, bromide and halogen, RoHS compliant, MSL1.",
